      "message": "Indeed, I was planning to do it. I had a comment in aosp/3786920/35/drivers/iommu/intel/pasid.c so that I do not forget(you commented on that comment - I admit that comment was very vague :-)). For moving it to pkvm, we need couple more values like ats_qdep, pfsid etc. I was trying to figure out if we can cache it in pkvm or pass it in param. Looks like its better to pass it in param for now and I shall move this to pkvm soon.",
